    <string>Sanctuary OS watches your Downloads folder to automatically intercept and scan downloaded mods for malware.</string>
    <key>NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Sanctuary OS requires Desktop access when your Vault or Screenshots folder is stored on the Desktop.</string>
    <key>NSRemovableVolumesUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Sanctuary OS requires access to external drives when your Game installation or Vault is stored on an external volume.</string>
